      "writtenOn": "2014-11-30T18:14:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we probably need to generate a host event in the case that we timeout on setting override (pd_send_host_event(PD_EVENT_POWER_CHANGE)). might want to ask sameer if this is necessary. or, we can leave it out for now and see how sameer\u0027s driver behaves on the failing case.",
      "revId": "6ad718ab232176004c8c29831d4b23a68049a083",
